    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels so weird being in the apartment alone tonight. like i walk into a room and i don't even realize i'm the one walking into it. everything in here was for us, and now that he's gone, i just feel like a ghost. i look in the mirror and there isnt even a person there anymore. just a shell.",
