      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this deep and painful disconnect from your own life and purpose. When life feels hollow and every action feels like a mistake, it can be incredibly hard to see a future, yet it is important to know that this state of being is not a reflection of your actual worth or potential. Even in the deepest moments of loss, small professional counseling sessions or a safe online chat can help you navigate this confusing terrain without needing to rebuild everything immediately. Please consider reaching out to a mental health professional who specializes in existential grief or trauma to help you find a path forward.",
